*   "How do my current blood panels look regarding my anemia?"
*   "Do I need to start or adjust any iron supplements, and if so, how will that interact with my current medications?"

### 4. Mental Health Check-in
*   "Given my history of depression, are there any routine mental health screenings we should do today?"
*   "Can we review how my current physical health and medications might be impacting my mood or energy levels?"

